        componentName: Html
        text: We may update this privacy policy at any time in order to reflect, for example, changes to our practices or for other operational, legal or regulatory reasons. If we make changes to this policy, we will notify you by email of updates, so that you are aware of information we collect, how we use it, and under what circumstances, if any.
